+/* Status -> Firewall as a flow chart (vantage-theme/nftflow.js): a Flow /
+   Rules table switch over LuCI's view; Flow hides LuCI's tables (they stay
+   in the DOM). The chart: one row, in -> prerouting -> a fork (input, this
